@host = http://localhost:5023

### GET all orders
GET {{host}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json

### GET order by id
GET {{host}}/api/orders/1
Accept: application/json

### POST create order
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Le Van C",
  "status": "pending"
}

### PUT update status
PUT {{host}}/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

"processing"